      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.DLn9BpdX9sVQS0dF.JournalEntryPage.Yw6GRD852RLVDyt0]{04. The Gardeners}.</strong> A herder boy of about ten on a plinth: enfeebled 3 and unable to act. NPC Core Commoner.</p>",
